Title: Judge's X Word Puzzle No. 24
Author: Catherine MacMillan
Date: 1927-10-08
Byline: Submitted by Catherine MacMillan, Chicago, Ill. Judge pays $10 for each puzzle printed.
Source: https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1927-10-08_93/page/n31/mode/1up
Number: 24
Solution-Source: https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1927-10-15_93/page/n30/mode/1up


